{"id":"15bb24af84739cac","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-rice-language-index-notation.md","title":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation — rice language index notation","display":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation — rice language index notation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation","display":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation — rice language index notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]","[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","[[73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-rice-language-index-notation","73-theorem-5.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-rice-language-index-notation — rice language index notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6759b2502900015f\" href=\"?note=6759b2502900015f\" title=\"73-df-enumerable-language-notation\">73-df-enumerable-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d543e6e6f293638\" href=\"?note=1d543e6e6f293638\" title=\"73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-rice-language-index-notation</span><span>73-theorem-5.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6759b2502900015f\" href=\"?note=6759b2502900015f\" title=\"73-df-enumerable-language-notation\">73-df-enumerable-language-notation</a> 的词语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\varphi_e)=\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\">\\(L(\\varphi_e)=\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a>；本结论的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\)</span> 取其数值集合实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>这里的性质是语言集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的成员关系，因而具有外延性；不再使用未定义的 nontrivialpropertyofr 谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.4}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\;\n\\bigl(\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal C\\ne\\mathrm{RE}\\to\n\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:L(\\varphi_e)\\in\\mathcal C\\}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.4}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\;\n\\bigl(\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal C\\ne\\mathrm{RE}\\to\n\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:L(\\varphi_e)\\in\\mathcal C\\}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选取性质内外的两个可识别语言，以是否发生某个停机事件控制开始识别所选语言，再有效输出程序码。空语言属于性质与否给出两个归约分支。该证明只依赖显示的语言外延性与固定有效程序编码，不要求对性质本身判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-enumerable-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-enumerable-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 是 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]] 的词语言类；$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$、$L(\\varphi_e)=\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；本结论的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 取其数值集合实例 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\varphi_e)=\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.4}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\;\n\\bigl(\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal C\\ne\\mathrm{RE}\\to\n\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:L(\\varphi_e)\\in\\mathcal C\\}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6759b2502900015f","219767ec839d8c84","1d543e6e6f293638"]}